{"id":"1f581262c09d5e34","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-arithmetical-realization.md","title":"Arithmetical Realization","display":"df-arithmetical-realization — Arithmetical Realization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","aliases":["89-df-arithmetical-realization"],"display":"df-arithmetical-realization — Arithmetical Realization","depends_on":["[[89-df-realization-function]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-arithmetical-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-arithmetical-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-realization — Arithmetical Realization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a50ebde4b7b3e426\" href=\"?note=a50ebde4b7b3e426\" title=\"89-df-realization-function\">89-df-realization-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\">\\(\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\)</span> is the\nset of realization functions from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a50ebde4b7b3e426\" href=\"?note=a50ebde4b7b3e426\" title=\"89-df-realization-function\">89-df-realization-function</a>.</li>\n<li>For each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathcal R_T\">\\(r\\in\\mathcal R_T\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{T,r}\">\\(\\tau_{T,r}\\)</span> is the structural\ntranslation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Real}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\tau_{T,r}\\in\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}}\n\\mid r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Real}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\tau_{T,r}\\in\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}}\n\\mid r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-realization-function","status":"resolved","id":"a50ebde4b7b3e426","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-realization-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-realization-function","status":"resolved","id":"a50ebde4b7b3e426","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}$ is the\nset of realization functions from [[89-df-realization-function]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-a